<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Bardolino Walking Tour Map — Prowalk Tours</name>
    <description><![CDATA[▶ Watch the video: https://youtu.be/V82QHnPREzI<br>Follow along with the Prowalk Tours 4K walking tour of Bardolino, Lake Garda, filmed during the Palio del Chiaretto wine festival on June 5, 2026. The route covers the old port, Piazza Matteotti, Chiesa di San Nicolò, Torre del Borgo, Lungolago Roma, the open-air market, Chiesa di San Severo, Porta San Giovanni, and the full wine festival promenade to the Monumento al Marinaio and back. 3 miles / 5 km.<br>]]></description>
